    "chapter": 54,
    "chapterTitle": "The Town-Ho’s Story",
    "quote": "Interweaving in its proper place this darker thread with the story as publicly narrated on the ship, the whole of this strange affair I now proceed to put on lasting record.",
    "goal": "Annotation colours that sit behind or under text: PDF and Zotero highlights, track changes, code and manuscript diffs, review comments, marking student work.",
